Subject: [PATCH] VR or Hall sensor chosen in software on crank and cam inputs
 (pro-style)

New triggerSensorType[] and camSensorType[] settings. Each crank and cam input has an
output (hallPullupCrank1..2, hallPullupCam1..4) that turns on the Hall pull-up of that
input on our board when its sensor type is Hall.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
